  "prefLabel": "Rev 2208.03 Period for Discovery",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2208.03 Period for Discovery.\n\n(a) The period for discovery of civil or criminal liability of the bonded official shall be consistent with applicable statutes of limitations.\n\n(b) The period for discovery as described in paragraph (a) above shall apply to the termination of the bond as an entirety, or to the termination of the term of office of any person filling any position stated in the schedule.\n\nSource. #5455, eff 8-28-92; ss by #6808, eff 7-21-98; ss by #8687, eff 7-21-06; ss by #10652, eff 8-8-14 (from Rev 2209.03); ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24",
